### VS Code REST Client extension: run the API first.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Login (username means email)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin@example.com&password=ChangeThisPassword123!

### Who am I?
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a course as admin
POST {{base}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"DS101","title":"Python Data Science","teacher_id":2,"capacity":20,"day_of_week":1,"start_time":"09:00:00","end_time":"10:30:00","room":"C-201"}

### List courses
GET {{base}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Student's own report (use student access token)
GET {{base}}/students/me/report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
